msgid "Let other programs guide with Sidralune"
msgstr "Ļaut citām programmām vadīt ar Sidralune"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Guiding.cs
msgid "Programs that can guide with PHD2 connect here instead, as if Sidralune's guider were PHD2. PHD2 itself must not use the same port."
msgstr "Programmas, kas prot vadīt ar PHD2, tā vietā pieslēdzas šeit, it kā Sidralune gids būtu PHD2. Pašam PHD2 nedrīkst izmantot to pašu portu."

#: Sidralune.Devices/Guiding/GuidePolarAlignment.cs
msgid "Drift alignment needs the mount connected, to know where it points."
msgstr "Izlīdzināšanai ar dreifu vajag pievienotu montējumu, lai zinātu, kur tas vērsts."

#: Sidralune.Devices/Guiding/GuidePolarAlignment.cs
msgid "Point near the celestial equator (Dec within ±30°): near the meridian for the azimuth error, or 25–35° up in the east or west for the altitude error."
msgstr "Vērsiet tuvu debess ekvatoram (Dec ±30° robežās): tuvu meridiānam azimuta kļūdai, vai 25–35° augstumā austrumos vai rietumos augstuma kļūdai."

#: Sidralune.Devices/Guiding/GuidePolarAlignment.cs
msgid "Near the meridian: this measures the azimuth error."
msgstr "Tuvu meridiānam: šeit mēra azimuta kļūdu."

#: Sidralune.Devices/Guiding/GuidePolarAlignment.cs
msgid "In the east: this measures the altitude error."
msgstr "Austrumos: šeit mēra augstuma kļūdu."

#: Sidralune.Devices/Guiding/GuidePolarAlignment.cs
msgid "In the west: this measures the altitude error."
msgstr "Rietumos: šeit mēra augstuma kļūdu."

#: Sidralune.Devices/Guiding/GuidePolarAlignment.cs
msgid "This measures the altitude error, though lower in the east or west would tell it better."
msgstr "Šeit mēra augstuma kļūdu, taču zemāk austrumos vai rietumos tā būtu labāk redzama."

#: Sidralune.Devices/Guiding/GuidePolarAlignment.cs
msgid "This measures the azimuth error, though nearer the meridian would tell it better."
msgstr "Šeit mēra azimuta kļūdu, taču tuvāk meridiānam tā būtu labāk redzama."

#: Sidralune.Devices/Guiding/GuidePolarAlignment.cs
msgid "Start guiding first: drift alignment measures while guiding with the Dec corrections held back."
msgstr "Vispirms sāciet vadību: izlīdzināšana ar dreifu mēra vadības laikā ar aizturētām Dec korekcijām."

#: Sidralune.Devices/Guiding/GuidePolarAlignment.cs
msgid "Move the polar axis {0} by {1:0.0}′"
msgstr "Pārvietojiet polāro asi {0} par {1:0.0}′"

#: Sidralune.Devices/Guiding/GuidePolarAlignment.cs
msgid "Stop guiding first: the mount turns between the frames."
msgstr "Vispirms apturiet vadību: montējums starp kadriem griežas."

#: Sidralune.Devices/Guiding/GuidePolarAlignment.cs
msgid "No guide frame came."
msgstr "Nepienāca neviens vadības kadrs."

#: Sidralune.Devices/Guiding/GuidePolarAlignment.cs
msgid "Frame {0} of 3…"
msgstr "Kadrs {0} no 3…"

#: Sidralune.Devices/Guiding/GuidePolarAlignment.cs
