msgstr "Kadru {0} neizdevās atrisināt astrometriski."

#: Sidralune.Devices/Guiding/GuidePolarAlignment.cs
msgid "Turning RA {0:0}° east…"
msgstr "RA tiek griezta par {0:0}° uz austrumiem…"

#: Sidralune.Devices/Guiding/GuidePolarAlignment.cs
