msgstr "{0:0} s: Dec dreifs {1:+0.00;-0.00}″/min ± {2:0.00}"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Turning RA"
msgstr "RA griešana"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "The mount turns itself"
msgstr "Montējums griež pats"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Point near the celestial pole. Sidralune takes a frame, turns RA about 15° west twice and plate-solves each frame: the mount's axis is the point the frames turn about, and the plate solution places the refracted pole. Then turn the altitude and azimuth knobs until the star reaches its circle."
msgstr "Vērsiet tuvu debess polam. Sidralune uzņem kadru, divreiz pagriež RA par aptuveni 15° uz rietumiem un katru kadru atrisina astrometriski: montējuma ass ir punkts, ap kuru kadri griežas, un astrometriskais risinājums novieto refrakcijas nobīdīto polu. Tad grieziet augstuma un azimuta skrūves, līdz zvaigzne sasniedz savu apli."

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Start alignment"
msgstr "Sākt izlīdzināšanu"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Next frame"
msgstr "Nākamais kadrs"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Mount axis"
msgstr "Montējuma ass"

#: Sidralune/Views/ObservatoryView.Polar.cs
msgid "Pole"
msgstr "Pols"

